.TH SETGID 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
setgid \- sets group ids according to linux credential and privilege rules
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <unistd.h>
.B int setgid(gid_t group);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Sets group IDs according to Linux credential and privilege rules. This is a direct per-thread syscall.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result on success, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR setgid (2)
